    "This is a deterministic retrieval/navigation benchmark, not an end-to-end coding-agent benchmark.",
    "The targeted baselines receive the same preprocessed query terms as agent-shunt.",
    "Targeted reads interleave the best hit from each ranked file before taking deeper hits from any file.",
    "The symbol baseline shares agent-shunt's structural resolver only after plain ripgrep has chosen a hit.",
    "Token counts use agent-shunt's conservative context estimator, not a provider billing tokenizer."
